velopment & Innovation Officer | GFS Consulting</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#1e293b;padding:20px;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px;text-align:center;\">\n<p style=\"color:#64748b;margin:0;font-size:12px;\">© 2026 GFS Consulting</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
